---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Bring VolnLabs one robot behavior change. We'll scope the failure cases and evidence needed to make that release decision.">
  <div class="min">
    <main id="main-content">
      <h1>Bring us one robot behavior change<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">We’re starting with inspection-robot manufacturers and integrators.</p>
      <p class="lead">Bring one existing controller, one workflow and a change you need to evaluate. We’ll start from the failure-and-recovery checks your engineers repeat by hand before trusting a robot again, and make them repeatable across every change.</p>
      <p>The starting point is your current stack, not a requirement to adopt Actryn.</p>

      <h2>Good reasons to reach out</h2>
      <ul class="rule-list">
        <li><strong>Release assessment</strong><p>You build or integrate inspection robots and have an upcoming behavior change to decide on.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Test access</strong><p>You can provide bench access, a controller or supervised field time for physical testing.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Technical review</strong><p>You work in controls, functional safety or cybersecurity and can review the assessment design.</p></li>
        <li><strong>Investment</strong><p>You want to discuss funding the first reproducible physical deployment and an integration hire.</p></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email is best for context. Use the calendar when a short first conversation is easier.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="mailto:utkarsh@volnlabs.com">utkarsh@volnlabs.com</a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/utkarsh-maurya/axiomos" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="secondary">Book a call</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Base>
